			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> don’t load it, instead pay a service to do it for you, so you can „focus on the important things.“</p><p>The service sells your consumption behavior based on the dishes you provide them. Also, the service sends you the dishes they are exclusively compatible with, and they instead of washing destroy it and send you new ones. Also, it’s free but forks and spoons require a cutlery premium subscription.</p>",
